          "path": "_m/g/c/p/v/abbey-road-studios-wp/schiedmayer-celeste-abbey-road.jpg",
          "filename": "Schiedmayer Celeste, Abbey Road Studios.jpg",
          "caption": "Schiedmayer Celeste\nThe Celeste is considered a classical instrument, with its beautiful\nbell-like tones played from a standard keyboard. After years of use\non classical orchestral pieces, it was discovered by rock and pop\ngroups eager for new sounds.\n\nMost famous for haunting introduction to Time, from Pink\nFloyd's legendary Dark Side of the Moon album, this very keyboard\nwas also used on Baby It's You and Goodnight by The Beatles.\n\n(quotes from description)",
          "alt": "Schiedmayer Celeste\nThe Celeste is considered a classical instrument, with its beautiful\nbell-like tones played from a standard keyboard. After years of use\non classical orchestral pieces, it was discovered by rock and pop\ngroups eager for new sounds.\n\nMost famous for haunting introduction to Time, from Pink\nFloyd's legendary Dark Side of the Moon album, this very keyboard\nwas also used on Baby It's You and Goodnight by The Beatles.\n\n(quotes from description)",
          "width": 2048,
          "height": 1536,
          "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
          "license": "CC BY 2.0",
          "artist": "Josephenus P. Riley",
